      "title": "本质理解",
      "section_type": "essence",
      "content": [
        "化学性质是物质通过化学反应表现出来的特性",
        "化学性质决定了物质能否发生某种化学反应"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:chemical-property"]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-points",
      "title": "核心要点",
      "section_type": "key_points",
      "content": [
        "常见的化学性质包括：可燃性、酸碱性、氧化性、还原性等"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:chemical-property"]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "典型例子",
      "section_type": "example",
      "content": [
        "可燃性：镁能在空气中燃烧",
        "酸碱性：维生素C泡腾片在水中能释放出气体"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:chemical-property"]
    },
    {
